.Dd February 3, 2026
.Dt PORT-MATROIDCTL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm port-matroidctl
.Nd control and inspect a port-matroidd node
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -control Ar path
.Op Fl -timeout-ms Ar ms
.Ar command
.Op Ar args ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm connects to the local control socket exposed by .Xr port-matroidd 1
and issues inspection or administration commands.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -control Ar path
Control socket path.
Default: .Pa /run/port-matroid/control.sock .
.It Fl -timeout-ms Ar ms
Request timeout in milliseconds.
Default: 2000.
.El
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm status
Print node status, epoch, routing digest, and snapshot height.
.It Cm peers
List known peers and replica membership summary.
.It Cm dump-snapshot Op Ar path
Write the current snapshot bytes to .Ar path or stdout if omitted.
.It Cm dump-wal Op Ar n
Dump last .Ar n WAL entries (for audit).
.It Cm validate Ar file
Validate and decode a message or fixture file.
Exit non-zero on failure.
.It Cm replay Ar trace
Replay a trace file against the pure state machine and report divergence.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr port-matroidd 1 ,
.Xr port-matroid.conf 5
